# Backend environment o'zgaruvchilari namunasi
# Bu faylni .env nomi bilan nusxalab, real qiymatlarni yoz
# .env hech qachon git'ga qo'shilmaydi (.gitignore'da)

# Database
DATABASE_URL=postgresql+asyncpg://fargonam:parol123@localhost:5432/fargonam_db

# Redis
REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379/0

# JWT
SECRET_KEY=bu_yerga_uzun_random_satr_yozishing_kerak_kamida_32_belgi
ACCESS_TOKEN_EXPIRE_MINUTES=15
REFRESH_TOKEN_EXPIRE_DAYS=7

# App
DEBUG=true

# Telegram login (mobile_user, mobile_seller, admin_web) — @BotFather orqali bot yaratib oling
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_BOT_USERNAME=
TELEGRAM_WEBHOOK_SECRET=
# true = long-polling (domen shart emas, lokal dev), false = webhook (production)
TELEGRAM_USE_POLLING=false
# Shu Telegram ID orqali kirgan foydalanuvchiga avtomatik admin huquqi beriladi.
# Raqamli ID (username emas) — Telegram'da @userinfobot ga /start yozib olinadi.
ADMIN_TELEGRAM_IDS=
